ed_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"MuJBELBk9VXJjH0tryDh1w","review_id":"coaGFCwSSPK5pvNFawUq-w","date":"2021-02-18T03:47:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9437578916549683,"text_excerpt":"Great happy hour spot! I came here with a friend on a weekday, so it wasn't too crowded. There is both indoor and outdoor seating, but it may be hard to find street parking. I ordered a Michelada, while she had the Sangria. It was so refreshing! Our server also brought a small bowl of popcorn, generously seasoned with butter, chili, and spices, which was a fantastic way to start our meal. The Guacamole came with fresh tortilla chips and was delicious and more than plenty for the both of us. I ordered the Steak Tacos and added a side of rice and beans for an extra $3. The steak was marinated well and cooked just right. It came with a bright tomatillo salsa that added great flavor. Be sure ..."},{"business_id":"MuJBELBk9VXJjH0tryDh1w","review_id":"Y2nBgSc7CrSULKwGTc8KJg","date":"2016-01-08T06:57:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.936471700668335,"text_excerpt":"I live nearby and am so glad to have a neighborhood restaurant with authentic Mexican food! My first visit I had the Chilaques which was perfect for a late Saturday brunch/lunch. Tonight we had the Chips and Salsas and Flautas for an Appetizer, the Fish Tacos which were recommend by our server Lisa (I was debating between the hanger steak or the fish tacos) and my friend had the Shrimp Burrito. We also shared the Plantains with Mole Sauce. All were delicious! The Fish was Drum and it was perfectly battered and super fresh. The cabbage slaw, marinated red onions and cilantro & onions were on the side. The corn tortilla had the look , feel and taste of homemade. The only thing I wish they h..."},{"business_id":"MuJBELBk9VXJjH0tryDh1w","review_id":"1SvQaGD2qYCC3Q59mkLkXA","date":"2016-09-06T16:09:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.93463534116745,"text_excerpt":"Really great food in a cute space with friendly staff. I drove by this place every day for months without realizing it was there - it's right at the corner where Broad becomes Fontainebleau, across from the Keller library. There's a small parking lot, but street spots are usually pretty easy to come by. It looks small from the outside but is pretty spacious inside. Things can get a little noisy in the dining room but nothing too crazy. The food I've had has been very fresh, well-seasoned, just all around tasty. The rajas con queso appetizer, which is a special, was my favorite on my first visit. On my second visit, there was a seafood queso instead, and the staff very nicely accommodated ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"MuJBELBk9VXJjH0tryDh1w","photo_id":"DSbE57Ppuo3Bdyls08pcJA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DSbE57Ppuo3Bdyls08pcJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9277424812316895},{"business_id":"MuJBELBk9VXJjH0tryDh1w","photo_id":"7kfV8vsB8cnJrW1cWfqNNw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/7kfV8vsB8cnJrW1cWfqNNw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.915617823600769},{"business_id":"MuJBELBk9VXJjH0tryDh1w","photo_id":"_Ac5215jLReBu-qE5H6t0A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_Ac5215jLReBu-qE5H6t0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.820980966091156},{"business_id":"MuJBELBk9VXJjH0t